{"id": "davis-family-payments", "title": "Two City grantees paid the director's son about $185,000", "seconds": 123.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "e1a2e57d516eb653", "words": 395, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "Sheryl Davis directed San Francisco’s Human Rights Commission, which handed out Dream Keeper grants.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.7, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Human Rights Commission", "sub": "director Sheryl Davis, Dream Keeper grants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.68, 1.06, 1.23, 1.72, 1.96, 2.19, 2.82, 3.04, 3.3, 3.44, 3.68, 3.98]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "The affidavit in her criminal case says money from two of those grantees reached her family.", "t0": 4.82, "t1": 9.18, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Arrest-warrant affidavit", "text": "Money from two Dream Keeper grantees reaching members of her family.", "mark": "her family", "source": "s1"}, "emph": ["her family"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.79, 0.9, 1.02, 1.37, 1.67, 1.9, 2.18, 2.38, 2.59, 2.69, 2.94, 3.52, 3.77, 3.9]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "First, Homeless Children’s Network.", "t0": 9.3, "t1": 10.84, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Homeless Children’s Network", "sub": "October 2021 to July 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.68, 1.08]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "From October 2021 to July 2024, what did it pay her adult son?", "t0": 10.96, "t1": 15.62, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Homeless Children’s Network", "sub": "October 2021 to July 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.57, 0.81, 1.33, 1.44, 1.76, 2.0, 2.95, 3.18, 3.31, 3.39, 3.54, 3.65, 3.92]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "amount"], "text": "139,200 dollars.", "t0": 15.62, "t1": 17.83, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$139,200", "label": "to her son, October 2021 to July 2024, alleged"}, "emph": ["139,200"], "wt": [0.04, 0.22, 0.43, 0.92, 1.35, 1.53, 1.75]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[5]", "defense[0]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction. The San Francisco Standard reported Davis pleaded not guilty.", "t0": 18.35, "t1": 23.93, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.42, 0.52, 0.63, 1.4, 1.59, 1.65, 2.66, 2.82, 3.03, 3.53, 4.0, 4.4, 4.72, 5.01, 5.18]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "links[2]", "links[3]"], "text": "Every payment went into a credit-union account he held jointly with his mother.", "t0": 24.15, "t1": 27.41, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "Homeless Children’s Network", "sub": "Dream Keeper grantee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "A joint credit-union account", "sub": "held by Davis and her son"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Four contract actions", "sub": "signed by Davis, 2022 and 2023"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the affidavit"}, "emph": ["jointly"], "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.66, 0.83, 1.01, 1.08, 1.66, 1.99, 2.1, 2.31, 2.64, 2.78, 2.89]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[1]", "links[0]"], "text": "Meanwhile, Davis signed four contract actions for the network.", "t0": 27.53, "t1": 30.45, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "Homeless Children’s Network", "sub": "Dream Keeper grantee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "A joint credit-union account", "sub": "held by Davis and her son"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Four contract actions", "sub": "signed by Davis, 2022 and 2023"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.78, 1.06, 1.34, 1.83, 2.19, 2.29, 2.39]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[1]", "links[0]"], "text": "Prosecutors charge four conflict-of-interest felonies.", "t0": 30.57, "t1": 33.24, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "Homeless Children’s Network", "sub": "Dream Keeper grantee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "A joint credit-union account", "sub": "held by Davis and her son"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Four contract actions", "sub": "signed by Davis, 2022 and 2023"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.6, 0.89, 1.19, 2.06]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Why a conflict? Money landing in an account she owned gave her a financial interest, prosecutors say.", "t0": 33.36, "t1": 38.6, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "Homeless Children’s Network", "sub": "Dream Keeper grantee"}, {"art": "money", "name": "A joint credit-union account", "sub": "held by Davis and her son"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Four contract actions", "sub": "signed by Davis, 2022 and 2023"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.29, 1.41, 1.69, 2.02, 2.12, 2.2, 2.59, 2.79, 3.13, 3.32, 3.43, 3.5, 3.97, 4.36, 4.93]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[8]"], "text": "In January 2024, it paid him to help prepare five slides, for a panel Davis moderated.", "t0": 38.72, "t1": 43.35, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Five slides", "kicker": "January 30, 2024", "sub": "for a panel Davis moderated"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.57, 0.82, 1.44, 1.56, 1.76, 1.88, 1.97, 2.14, 2.46, 2.69, 3.34, 3.51, 3.57, 3.84, 4.12]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[8]"], "text": "How much?", "t0": 43.47, "t1": 44.06, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Five slides", "kicker": "January 30, 2024", "sub": "for a panel Davis moderated"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "links[5]"], "text": "10,000 dollars.", "t0": 44.06, "t1": 45.1, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,000", "label": "for five slides"}, "emph": ["10,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.55]}, {"scene": "hcn", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "But the affidavit can’t tell if City money paid him. The network’s records point to private donations.", "t0": 45.62, "t1": 50.41, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the network’s records point to private donations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.2, 0.74, 0.93, 1.13, 1.23, 1.48, 1.7, 1.93, 2.44, 2.62, 3.03, 3.44, 3.67, 3.77, 4.06]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "links[7]", "established[3]"], "text": "The second grantee, Collective Impact, was run by James Spingola, who shared a home with Davis.", "t0": 50.63, "t1": 55.53, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Collective Impact", "kicker": "The second grantee", "sub": "run by James Spingola", "chip": "more than $45,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 1.04, 1.49, 2.24, 2.44, 2.61, 2.75, 3.01, 3.66, 3.84, 4.05, 4.11, 4.27, 4.4]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "It paid more than 45,000 dollars to or for the son.", "t0": 55.65, "t1": 58.91, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Collective Impact", "kicker": "The second grantee", "sub": "wages, rent and tuition for the son", "chip": "more than $45,000"}, "emph": ["45,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.33, 0.53, 0.71, 1.18, 1.52, 1.87, 2.34, 2.63, 2.83, 2.93]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "Wages, rent and UCLA tuition.", "t0": 59.03, "t1": 60.81, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Collective Impact", "kicker": "The second grantee", "sub": "wages, rent and tuition for the son", "chip": "more than $45,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.71, 0.86, 1.29]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "The tuition, 19,070.01 dollars,", "t0": 60.93, "t1": 64.8, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the grant’s cap, per the City Attorney", "$5,000 a year"], "b": ["his tuition, billed to it", "$19,070.01"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 1.17, 1.64, 2.06, 2.42, 2.84, 2.99, 3.22]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "was billed to a City job-training grant.", "t0": 64.8, "t1": 66.45, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the grant’s cap, per the City Attorney", "$5,000 a year"], "b": ["his tuition, billed to it", "$19,070.01"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.48, 0.6, 0.67, 0.91, 1.41]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "Its cap, says the City Attorney: 5,000 dollars a year.", "t0": 66.57, "t1": 69.76, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the grant’s cap, per the City Attorney", "$5,000 a year"], "b": ["his tuition, billed to it", "$19,070.01"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.75, 0.97, 1.08, 1.31, 1.9, 2.17, 2.5, 2.81, 2.89]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "That isn’t charged as a conflict. He was no longer her dependent, and she’d stopped signing its contracts.", "t0": 69.88, "t1": 75.28, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Not charged as a conflict", "sub": "no longer her dependent; she had stopped signing its contracts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.45, 0.77, 0.88, 0.97, 1.98, 2.14, 2.3, 2.47, 2.8, 2.93, 3.5, 3.69, 3.95, 4.29, 4.59, 4.73]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]", "links[8]"], "text": "It also bought at least 28,000 dollars of kits for Davis’s children’s book.", "t0": 75.4, "t1": 79.32, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Collective Impact", "sub": "bought kits"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Rudi’s Girls", "sub": "Texas, owned by two half-sisters"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Sheryl Davis", "sub": "her own children’s book"}], "kicker": "$28,000 or more"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.43, 0.72, 0.84, 1.07, 1.52, 1.85, 2.15, 2.27, 2.6, 2.75, 3.16, 3.57]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]", "links[8]"], "text": "The seller, Rudi’s Girls, is owned by two of her half-sisters.", "t0": 79.44, "t1": 82.56, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Collective Impact", "sub": "bought kits"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Rudi’s Girls", "sub": "Texas, owned by two half-sisters"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Sheryl Davis", "sub": "her own children’s book"}], "kicker": "$28,000 or more"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.72, 1.08, 1.41, 1.57, 1.83, 1.98, 2.16, 2.26, 2.38]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "links[10]"], "text": "And the two grantees paid each other: 400,000 dollars one way, 60,000 back.", "t0": 82.68, "t1": 87.33, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Collective Impact to the network", "$150,000, $150,000, $100,000"], "b": ["the network to Collective Impact", "$50,000 and $10,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.25, 0.46, 0.98, 1.19, 1.37, 1.77, 2.05, 2.29, 2.63, 2.93, 3.1, 3.59, 3.94, 4.27]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "links[10]"], "text": "Invoices were found, but nothing describing the work.", "t0": 87.45, "t1": 89.99, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Collective Impact to the network", "$150,000, $150,000, $100,000"], "b": ["the network to Collective Impact", "$50,000 and $10,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.64, 1.0, 1.21, 1.59, 2.02, 2.11]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "The son’s total from both? 185,000 dollars.", "t0": 90.11, "t1": 93.92, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$185,000", "label": "to the son from the two nonprofits, per the affidavit"}, "emph": ["185,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.79, 0.98, 2.08, 2.26, 2.51, 2.96, 3.31]}, {"scene": "ci", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "The affidavit calls it an appearance of impropriety.", "t0": 94.44, "t1": 96.78, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "appearance of impropriety"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.66, 0.93, 1.03, 1.11, 1.51, 1.61]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]", "timeline[6]"], "text": "The Controller also found the Commission paid the network", "t0": 97.0, "t1": 99.39, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Gift cards, no receipts", "sub": "Controller audit, 2023", "chip": "$10,407"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.62, 0.95, 1.2, 1.29, 1.76, 1.94, 2.05]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]", "timeline[6]"], "text": "10,407 dollars for gift cards, without receipts.", "t0": 99.39, "t1": 102.78, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Gift cards, no receipts", "sub": "Controller audit, 2023", "chip": "$10,407"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.3, 0.7, 0.92, 1.16, 1.4, 1.69, 1.82, 2.03, 2.52, 2.86]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[5]", "defense[1]"], "text": "Davis told Mission Local she knew nothing of the tuition.", "t0": 102.9, "t1": 105.4, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "A hearing officer, 2025", "sub": "declined to debar Collective Impact"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.56, 0.89, 1.23, 1.37, 1.53, 1.83, 1.91, 2.0]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[5]", "defense[1]"], "text": "A hearing officer declined to bar Collective Impact over it.", "t0": 105.52, "t1": 108.07, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "A hearing officer, 2025", "sub": "declined to debar Collective Impact"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.74, 1.12, 1.21, 1.44, 1.81, 2.17, 2.43]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Not shown: that City money paid the son through the network, or that he didn’t do the work.", "t0": 108.19, "t1": 113.01, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That City money paid the son through the network", "That he did not do the research he was paid for"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 1.35, 1.56, 1.85, 2.11, 2.32, 2.43, 2.61, 2.82, 2.93, 3.52, 3.69, 3.86, 3.96, 4.2, 4.32, 4.42]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "The network’s invoices to its City grants would show whether his pay was billed to the City.", "t0": 113.13, "t1": 117.2, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The network’s invoices to its City grants, 2021 to 2024"}, {"who": "", "what": "Collective Impact’s ledger for Rudi’s Girls"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.59, 1.14, 1.28, 1.41, 1.67, 2.06, 2.29, 2.54, 2.82, 2.94, 3.13, 3.27, 3.52, 3.62, 3.72]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The network, the son and the half-sisters are not charged.", "t0": 117.32, "t1": 120.13, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.76, 0.91, 1.19, 1.3, 1.41, 2.0, 2.13, 2.3]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 120.25, "t1": 122.39, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "hcn": "The network · $139,200", "ci": "Collective Impact · $45,000", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}